WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: The Hollow Square (1-01)
NOTE Artist: Fractured Prisms
NOTE Album: Carnaby Street (1983)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:32.000
[Brooding Drum Machine & Pulsing Analog Synth Intro]

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:36.000
Four empty spaces in the room

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:43.200
A silent echo in the gloom

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:50.200
We crossed the water to find a shore

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:56.000
But left behind what came before

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:04.200
The city lights are cold and bright

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:12.000
A different sky, a different night

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:16.500
Standing in the hollow square!

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:23.800
Reaching out, but no one's there!

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.800
We forge the armour, paint the sky

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:35.000
To keep the fading embers high!

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:39.000
In the hollow square...

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:49.500
[Atmospheric Synth Interlude]

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:53.600
The cables hum, the circuits glow

00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:00.200
To mask the quiet down below

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:07.500
We sequence notes to fill the void

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:13.200
A symphony we re-employed

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:21.200
Just two remain to hold the line

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:29.000
And reconstruct the grand design

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:33.500
Standing in the hollow square!

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:40.800
Reaching out, but no one's there!

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:44.800
We forge the armour, paint the sky

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:51.200
To keep the fading embers high!

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:54.500
In the hollow square...

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:05.800
The stage is smaller, but the sound is deep

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:12.000
A promise that we swore to keep

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:19.200
Through the silence, hear the spark

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:26.000
We light the beacons in the dark!

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:52.200
[Soaring Melodic Guitar Solo]

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:58.200
Standing in the hollow square!

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:04.200
Reaching out, but no one's there!

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:08.200
We forge the armour, paint the sky

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:14.200
To keep the fading embers high!

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:17.500
In the hollow square!

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:21.500
The hollow square...

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:26.500
We hold the line...

